pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Fair AI gate (#482): the fh1-race entry into the point-to-point PROGRESS
# event of the appdata-2026-09-27 seed, then the player stays on the grid for
# about 100 s while the AI drive away. Run with
# --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_ai_trace=true and
# --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_ai_opponents=<stock|fair|hard> (the v4 build
# works the same with a v4 seed); tools/summarize-ai-trace.py then reads
# each AI's gap to the player, rubber-band mode, catch-up and torque from the
# ai.trace events. Stock AI that lead by their start distance cut torque
# (mode 8) and wait; with no rubber-banding they keep their pace.
# clock-hz 60
# expect-race-hud race-30s
